  "title": "Spinach and Mushroom Quiche with Shiitake Mushrooms",
  "description": "This savory egg quiche is a mouthwatering combination of fresh spinach, shiitake mushrooms, broccoli, turkey bacon, and sharp Cheddar cheese.",
  "authors": [
    "EATMORCHIKIN"
  ],
